---
import '../styles/hsin-soundtrack.css';
---
<aside class="hsin-soundtrack hsin-music-tower" data-hsin-soundtrack data-music-tower
  data-tower-state="idle" data-provider="none" data-soundtrack-side="right"
  aria-label="Farol lunar · estação musical da Hsin">
  <div class="hsin-music-tower__crown" aria-hidden="true"><span>✦</span></div>
  <section class="hsin-music-tower__facade" aria-labelledby="hsin-music-tower-title">
    <header class="hsin-music-tower__heading">
      <div><p class="hsin-music-tower__eyebrow">Observatório · estação 01</p><h2 id="hsin-music-tower-title">Farol lunar</h2></div>
      <div class="hsin-music-tower__actions">
        <button type="button" data-soundtrack-side-toggle aria-label="Mover farol para a esquerda" title="Alternar lado">⇄</button>
        <button type="button" data-soundtrack-options-toggle aria-controls="hsin-soundtrack-options" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Opções e créditos" title="Opções e créditos">ⓘ</button>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="hsin-music-tower__providers" role="group" aria-label="Escolher música">
      <button type="button" data-music-provider="youtube" aria-pressed="false">YouTube</button>
      <button type="button" data-music-provider="spotify" aria-pressed="false">Spotify</button>
      <button type="button" data-music-provider="none" aria-pressed="true">Sem música</button>
    </div>
    <!-- A moldura termina fora do embed: nada cobre ou recorta o player. -->
    <div class="hsin-music-tower__display" data-soundtrack-player>
      <div class="hsin-music-tower__idle" data-soundtrack-placeholder data-tower-fallback="lunar-sigil">
        <div class="hsin-music-tower__sigil" aria-hidden="true"><span>☾</span></div>
        <p>A lua também sabe ouvir o silêncio.</p>
        <span class="hsin-music-tower__idle-label">Ode to Hsin and Moon</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="hsin-music-tower__status" data-soundtrack-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Escolha uma trilha ou contemple em silêncio.</p>
    <div class="hsin-music-tower__info" id="hsin-soundtrack-options" data-soundtrack-options hidden>
      <div class="hsin-music-tower__starts" role="group" aria-label="Ponto de início no YouTube">
        <button type="button" data-soundtrack-start="0">Faixa completa</button>
        <button type="button" data-soundtrack-start="66">Refrão ≈ 1:06</button>
      </div>
      <p>Use o Play do provedor. No Spotify, a reprodução disponível depende da conta, região e navegador.</p>
      <p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yhf9ur3xPQA" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">YouTube oficial ↗</a> · <a href="https://open.spotify.com/album/0l7zzxlw0HfvGYAJiiWU2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Spotify ↗</a> · <a href="https://music.apple.com/us/album/ode-to-hsin-and-moon-original-game-soundtrack/6812959103" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apple Music ↗</a></p>
      <p>© 2026 <strong>KURO GAMES</strong> · Wuthering Waves. Composição: Jin Dazhou; voz: Jaime Arin; letras: SmileL e Kat Kennedy; arranjo: He Shan. Portfólio independente, não afiliado à KURO GAMES.</p>
    </div>
    <noscript><p class="hsin-music-tower__info">As opções musicais precisam de JavaScript. <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yhf9ur3xPQA" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ouvir a faixa oficial no YouTube ↗</a></p></noscript>
  </section>
  <div class="hsin-music-tower__pedestal" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><span>✧</span><i></i></div>
</aside>
<script>
  import {mountHsinSoundtrack} from '../scripts/hsin-soundtrack';
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-hsin-soundtrack]').forEach(mountHsinSoundtrack);
</script>
